OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Barrackdeep
Description	Wild beasts of every kind roam the deep caves of Barrackdeep, one kennel after another. Win them over, house them well and raise a great army. Heroes keep a small outpost in the north-east. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Barrackdeep
SandboxTarget	32000
SandboxBonus	creatures	30	6500	-	Gather thirty fighting creatures
SandboxBonus	levelAtLeast	10	6500	4	Train ten creatures to level four
SandboxNext	skirmish/Embervault.level
[/Info]

