[Triggers]
Region	KennelEast	46	50	58	60
Region	Hollow	36	30	47	42
Region	Outpost	60	8	74	19
Region	Pens	24	44	33	52
[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Barrackdeep, master. The caves are full of wild beasts that nobody has claimed. Build lairs and a hatchery, and every creature you win over will fight for you.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	pens
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Pens
Action	message	1	Trolls and orcs live in these pens. Feed them and they will join your dungeon.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hollow
Action	message	1	A cultist hollow around a dark pool. The cultists will follow a keeper who offers them gold.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	kennel
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	KennelEast
Action	message	1	Lava spawn and demons dwell in the east kennel. Keep them fed and they stay loyal.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	outpost
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Outpost
Action	message	1	The heroes have an outpost here, and two coffers they never open. Take the gold when you can.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	pensWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	Pens	claimed	>=	15
Action	message	1	The pens are yours and a spring of mana has opened among them. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	28	48	28	48	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
